	(text "SC-02 FLOOR BOARD v2.0 - the whole car floor is this PCB (2 mm, 4 layers): ESP32-S3 + 2x DRV8871 + INA226 + 5 V 5 A buck (generated by tools/build_sch.py from tools/design.py)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15 552 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "a04740e4-7f3b-5434-8e60-fe002c8b7d42")
	)
	(text "Battery: XT60 -> 10 A fuse -> power switch (pads, switch in the floor hole) -> P-MOSFET reverse protection -> 2 mOhm shunt (INA226 0x40) -> VBUS: motors + buck."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15 556 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "ea0d6303-aa69-52d0-aaa5-a9c8eb567d23")
	)
	(text "Motors: DRV8871 IN1/IN2 (M1: IO4/IO5, M2: IO6/IO7), current limit 64 / 18k = 3.55 A. Servo IO9 (100 R), hall A3144 IO38 (10k pull-up), lights IO11 (AO3400A), panel ADC IO8 (100k/33k)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15 560 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "9970e43f-6410-555c-aca4-8f8bb124a5b4")
	)
	(text "Pi 4: UART pads (ESP IO17 TX / IO18 RX via 1k) to Pi pins 8/10 + 5V PI pads (pin 2/4 + 6). USB-C at the floor edge (body opening) for flashing. ELRS receiver (RadioMaster RP2, CRSF 420k) on IO15 TX / IO16 RX."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15 564 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
